readme
  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
  ║  C H A T T E R   —   A I   C H A T   G E N E R A T O R   v2  ║
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
  This list is never referenced anywhere — it exists purely as an in-editor
  README, since Perchance's list format has no comment syntax.
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [ FEATURES ]
  » multiple AI contacts, each with its own independent conversation
  » per-contact personality: traits, speech style, reply length, emoji usage, topics to avoid, temperature
  » three-tier memory — short-term + long-term summaries, plus a rolling internal-monologue "chain of thought" that ages into a core memory
  » a clinical who/what/when/where/why/how scenario tracker, refreshed alongside memory
  » light/dark theme, accent color, bubble style, font size
  » per-contact chat backgrounds, avatars/photos
  » message reactions, quote-replies, edit-last-message-and-resend, regenerate-last-reply(-and-thought)
  » character-card (chara_card_v2) import/export per contact, incl. lorebook activation
  » full backup import/export — localStorage-only persistence, no server
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [ USAGE ]
  » click + in the sidebar to add a contact (Profile / Personality / Behavior / Card tabs)
  » ...or hit Randomize to pull seed values from the lists below and have the AI expand them into a full character across all four tabs
  » type a message, press Enter to send
  » press Enter on an empty message to make the character double-text you
  » kebab menu (⋮) ---> pin / mute / clear / delete
  » Settings (⚙) ---> theme, your name/persona, data export/import
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [ DATA ]
  » everything lives in THIS browser's localStorage, under one key
  » export a backup regularly -- clearing site data or switching browsers loses it otherwise!
  ──────────────────────────────── [ eof ] ──────────────────────────────────

$meta
  description = A chat interface with AI contacts, memory, and customization
  title = AI Chat
  header
    mode = minimal

output
  Every stranger is a story waiting to unfold.
  Some conversations change everything.
  New voice, new world.
  You never know who's on the other side.
  A new thread begins.
  Two paths crossing unexpectedly in the digital noise.
  A connection made of light and text.
  An unexpected message from a familiar stranger.
  The quiet glow of a screen, and suddenly, a connection.
  Every whisper here holds a universe of its own.

